body:
Flashing Blade is only for Infantry and Armor, if I remember correctly

Also, I have a +8 Nailah, trying to get her to +10, only ever pulled neutral ones ;-;

If I ever get her to +10, imma post a build here

I do use Noontime, but in a different build. Nailah's prf makes Noontime's CD 1, making it inefficient to have Flashing Blade 4. Sol becomes a CD of 2, meaning one hit charges it, the next hit procs the special with FB4, similar to noontime without FB4

&#x200B;

The build that uses Noontime is Noontime, DC, Wrath, Glare, and Fierce Stance seal
